							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Grats, Conviction.  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br />I personally can&#039;t wait to get down and dirty with Time. But maybe I don&#039;t know what I&#039;m in for... I joined UoP after they were done with VT, so I don&#039;t really know what farming is...<br /><br />But <b>damn</b> do I want a Hopebringer and a Shield of Strife!<br /><br />-edit- Woot, post #69!
